{"meta":{"id":"tt0061643","type":"movie","name":"Fando y Lis","imdb_id":"tt0061643","description":"La opera prima de Alejandro Jodorowsky es un cuento bizarro de inocencia corrompida, amor sadomasoquista e inalcanzable paraíso. Basada en la obra homónima de Fernando Arrabal, cuenta la historia de una joven pareja en busca de la ciudad encantada de Tar, donde se encuentra el éxtasis espiritual. Fando es impotente y Lis está paralítica.","poster":"https://btttr.cc/poster-q/imdb/poster-default/tt0061643.jpg?tag=none&lang=es-MX&rs=IM","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qoEwJ3Z9okEclRrC7Sim4dVAeDy.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/z2eQRFDXn3ttblFfxTewuaQtKku.png","genres":["Romance","Aventura","Fantasía"],"releaseInfo":"1972","released":"1972-06-08T12:00:00.000Z","status":"Released","runtime":"97 min","imdbRating":"6.7","country":"Mexico","cast":["Sergio Kleiner","Diana Mariscal","María Teresa Rivas","Tamara Garina","Juan José Arreola","Rene Rebetez","Amparo Villegas","Miguel Álvarez Acosta","Raul Romero","Julio Castillo","Adrián Ramos","Henry West","Luis Urias","Valerie Jodorowsky","Graciela R. de Mariscal","Tina French","Fuensanta Zertuche","Julia Marichal","Freddy Marichal","Alejandro Romero","Hector Mariscal","Rosita Oliver","Elizabeth Moore","Vicente Moore","Greta Cohen","Basha","Miguel Kafka","Pablo Leder","Alina Sánchez","Roberto Cirou"],"director":["Alejandro Jodorowsky"],"writer":["Alejandro Jodorowsky","Fernando Arrabal"],"trailers":[{"source":"a8j8mDbroLc","type":"Trailer","name":"Alejandro Jodorowsky's Fando y Lis - Official Trailer | ABKCO Films","ytId":"a8j8mDbroLc","lang":"en"}],"trailerStreams":[{"ytId":"a8j8mDbroLc","title":"Alejandro Jodorowsky's Fando y Lis - Official Trailer | ABKCO Films"}],"links":[{"name":"6.7","category":"imdb","url":"https://imdb.com/title/tt0061643"},{"name":"Romance","category":"Genres","url":"stremio:///discover/https%3A%2F%2Fv3-cinemeta.strem.io%2Fmanifest.json/movie/top?genre=Romance"},{"name":"